@startuml sm1_game
!include style.iuml
title SM-1  Game (GameStatus) - state diagram
hide empty description
[*] --> WAITING : joinOnlineGame()\n[no opponent waiting]\n/ GameRecord saved
[*] --> IN_PROGRESS : joinOnlineGame()\n[opponent already waiting]\n/ colours drawn at random
[*] --> IN_PROGRESS : createComputerGame()\n/ player is Black
WAITING --> IN_PROGRESS : secondPlayerJoins\n[same board size]\n/ colours drawn at random
WAITING --> CANCELLED : leaveGame()\n[still waiting]
WAITING --> CANCELLED : pollTimeout\n[host gone > 30 s]
IN_PROGRESS --> FINISHED : playTurn()\n[neither player has a valid move]\n/ result = more pieces or draw
IN_PROGRESS --> FINISHED : leaveGame() or pollGame()\n[player quits or opponent gone > 30 s]\n/ forfeit(color)
FINISHED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
FINISHED : entry / count pieces, set winner or draw
FINISHED : entry / update PlayerProfile wins, losses, draws
@enduml
